{"$comment":"渲染性能基线参数矩阵。构建流水线与本地开发共用 perf/baseline.json 这一份门槛，修改本文件后需要重新生成基线（npm run perf:update）。","canvas":{"width":1600,"height":900},"latitude":39.9,"startTimeMs":1735689600000,"timeStepMs":3600000,"warmupFrames":30,"measureFrames":200,"globalWarmupFrames":200,"trimTailFraction":0.05,"$comment-trim":"统计前丢弃每帧耗时中最高的 5%（操作系统调度/GC 抢占造成的零星离群帧），用截尾后的均值与最差帧作为指标；真实回归会抬高全部帧而不是个别帧。修改此值需重新生成基线。","zoomTiers":[{"id":"low","zoom":0.5,"$comment":"低档：缩小，覆盖更密集的网格与投影计算"},{"id":"mid","zoom":1,"$comment":"中档：默认缩放"},{"id":"high","zoom":2.5,"$comment":"高档：放大，星体光晕半径与标签字号最大"}],"layerCombos":[{"id":"all-off","showLabels":false,"showConstLines":false,"showGrid":false,"$comment":"三个图层全部关闭"},{"id":"labels-only","showLabels":true,"showConstLines":false,"showGrid":false},{"id":"lines-only","showLabels":false,"showConstLines":true,"showGrid":false},{"id":"grid-only","showLabels":false,"showConstLines":false,"showGrid":true},{"id":"labels-lines","showLabels":true,"showConstLines":true,"showGrid":false},{"id":"labels-grid","showLabels":true,"showConstLines":false,"showGrid":true},{"id":"lines-grid","showLabels":false,"showConstLines":true,"showGrid":true},{"id":"all-on","showLabels":true,"showConstLines":true,"showGrid":true,"$comment":"三个图层全部打开"}],"headroom":1.5,"jitterFloorMs":0.05,"worstJitterFloorMs":0.08,"$comment-threshold":"mean(截尾) 门槛 = max(实测mean × headroom, 实测mean + jitterFloorMs)；worst(截尾后最差帧) 门槛同理但使用 worstJitterFloorMs。明显回归（几毫秒跳到几十毫秒）时倍数项自然生效。"}
